    <Element Type="Comment" Id="E5EC74C6">
        <Comment>
            The insertion sort algorithm is fairly simple and moderately efficient for small lists and mostly-sorted lists.
            It works by taking one element at a time from the list and inserting that element in its correct position in
            a new sorted list.
        </Comment>
    </Element>
